From: cunninghamcard-bit
 <269104167+cunninghamcard-bit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:29:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(input): extend corner swipe zones along the edges

Corner zones were only the 48px squares where two edge strips meet,
about one fingertip, so corner swipes starting just outside the square
ran the edge's action.

Extend each corner zone along both edge strips to CORNER_ZONE_PX
(150px) from the corner. A diagonal swipe there fires the corner; a
straight one that never completes the corner still fires the edge strip
it started in. The square itself keeps its behaviour.
---
